  "explanation": "For each node, recursively compute maximum branch gains from left and right subtrees (pruning negative gains with max(gain, 0)). The arch path through this node is node.val + leftGain + rightGain. Global max path is updated continuously.",
  "pseudoCode": "FUNCTION maxPathSum(root):\n    maxSum = -INFINITY\n    FUNCTION getMaxGain(node):\n        IF node IS NULL THEN RETURN 0\n        leftGain = MAX(getMaxGain(node.left), 0)\n        rightGain = MAX(getMaxGain(node.right), 0)\n        maxSum = MAX(maxSum, node.val + leftGain + rightGain)\n        RETURN node.val + MAX(leftGain, rightGain)\n    END FUNCTION\n    getMaxGain(root)\n    RETURN maxSum\nEND FUNCTION",
